# Super Expander Chip (C64): its keywords and tokens, from petcat (VICE 3.7.1): petcat -wsxc.
# Use it in a BASIC file with: tokenfile super-expander-chip
# BASIC V2's keywords are here too, so the longest keyword that matches is the one taken.
# Left out, as their tokens hold a $00 (which ends a line): key

